## 🎯 Day 57 Objective

Day 55 defined the maturity model. A rubric in a README doesn't get used in a boardroom — so this is the same model built as a **working instrument**: five tabs, live weighted scoring, automated band classification, hard-gate logic that overrides the score, and a radar comparison of current versus target state.

Built for one specific moment: a governance lead has two hours, eight stakeholders, and needs to walk out with a scored baseline nobody can dispute and a sequenced Q1 focus.

