**Mechanics:** yellow cells with blue bold text are inputs; grey cells are calculated. Score cells are constrained to whole numbers 1–5 by data validation — **a half-point entry is rejected with an error message**, which enforces the "no partial credit" rule at the cell level rather than by asking nicely. The 1.5× weights on D2 and D6 carry cell comments explaining why. 87 formulas, verified with zero errors.

